 Window closes on fold newest (incl. epoch-1 owner); never on the lease | `Decide` → `bootstrapWindowClosed`; `Run` → `LoadNewestCheckpoint` | `TestDecideWindowEpochOneOwnerCloses`, `TestRunEpochOneOwnerAfterCheckpoint`, `TestRunWindowLeaseCheckpointNullFoldRefuses` |\n21|| Post-window new op records + launches (both modes) | `Run` → `Store.Supersede` | `TestRunPostWindowSupersedes`, `TestRunCreateFromStoppedPostWindow` |\n22|| Identical retry replays any recorded pair | `Store.Lookup`; `Run` reattach | `TestRunSupersededPairIdenticalRetry`, `TestSupersedeKeepsReceipts` |\n23|| Supersede is no-replace per pair + reports replay | `Store.Supersede` → `installPair`; `Run` flip | `TestSupersedeConcurrentDifferentOps`, `TestSupersedeConcurrentSamePairReplays`, `TestRunPostWindowSamePairRaceReattaches` |\n24|| Crash seams converge (both install paths) | `Store` + `Hooks` | `TestBindCrashChildSelfTerminates`, `TestSupersedeCrashSeams` |\n25|| Unknown is not absent (anchor/pair/lease/fold) | `Store.Status`/`Lookup`/`SessionBound`; `Run` | `TestStatusUnknownIsNotAbsent`, `TestRunTornBindingPropagates`, `TestRunTornLeasePropagates`, `TestRunUnfoldableChainFails` |\n26|| After-restore 1-5 (fencing precedes materialization; both owners) | `Decide` restore mode | `TestDecideAfterRestoreSequence`, `TestDecideRemoteOwnerPrecedesMaterialization`, `TestDecidePostTakeoverDivergedBaseLaunches`, `TestRunPostTakeoverRestoreLaunchesWithNewestClosure` |\n27|| Remote parks / offers, no remote emission | `Decide` → `decideParked`; `Run` | `TestRunRemoteNonInteractiveParksWithoutEmission` |\n28|| Credential conditional, every caller | `Decide` → `checkRealm` | `TestDecideForegroundCredentialRequiresRealm`, `TestRunSmokeRequiredPasses` |\n29|| Realm row binds host/build/generation; any-match | `Decide` → `checkRealmBinding` | `TestDecideRealmEvidenceOrderIndependent`, `TestDecideRealmBindingMismatchRefuses` |\n30|| Dead realm row → typed capability_unavailable | `Decide` → `deadRealmRefusal` | `TestDecideExpiredRealmRowRefusesUnavailable`, `TestDecidePreRebootRealmRowRefusesUnavailable` |\n31|| Live row + backend fault keeps backend class | `Decide` → `admitBackend` | `TestDecideLiveRealmRowBackendFaultStands` |\n32|| Cached evidence never authorizes | `Decide` → `checkRealm` + `checkSmoke` | `TestRealmCarriesNoCachedEvidence` |\n33|| Non-interactive create requires headless_creation | `Decide` → backend conditionals | `TestDecideNonInteractiveRequiresHeadless` |\n34|\n35|## Backend / capabilities (§4.B, §4.D)\n36|\n37|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n38|| --- | --- | --- |\n39|| Manifest/probe/evidence identity + reconcile | `Decide` → `admitBackend` | `TestDecideTable` backend rows |\n40|| Only admitted rows authorize | `terminalbackend` via `Decide` | `TestDecideTable`, `TestDecideTable/refused_backend_capability_unproven` |\n41|| Operation, entrypoint, descriptor admission | `Decide` | `TestDecideRestoreRequiresRestoreCapability`, entrypoint/descriptor rows |\n42|\n43|## Terminal events (§5.2)\n44|\n45|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n46|| --- | --- | --- |\n47|| session.parked vocabulary + authorship under lease | `EmitParked` → `Emit` → `AuthorizeMutation` | `TestEmitParkedRoundTrip`, `TestEmitParkedVocabularyLoop`, `TestRunParkedEmits` |\n48|| Losing-lease emission refused at mutation gate | `Emit` → `AuthorizeMutation` | `TestEmitUnderLosingLeaseRefuses` |\n49|| Remote/unverifiable/unfolderable parks emit nothing | `Run` pre-checks; `Emit` fold gate | `TestRunParkedUnfoldableSkipsEmission`, `TestEmitParkedUnfoldableRefuses` |\n50|| v4 terminal binding payloads | `TerminalCreatedPayload`, `ResumedPayload`, `Emit` | `TestTerminalCreatedPayload`, `TestResumedPayload`, `TestEmitTerminalV4RoundTrip` |\n51|\n52|## Newest checkpoint (§5.7, §13.11, §14.4)\n53|\n54|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n55|| --- | --- | --- |\n56|| Newest derived from chain fold | `LoadNewestCheckpoint` → `sessstate.Reduce` | `TestRunEpochOneOwnerAfterCheckpoint` |\n57|| Null fold + requirement parks (journal/checkpoint) | `checkMaterialization` / `admitCheckpoint` | `TestDecideJournalNullFoldParks`, `TestDecideCheckpointNullFoldParks`, `TestRunNullFoldRestoreParks` |\n58|| Unpublished checkpoint parks | `admitCheckpoint` newest arm | `TestDecideCheckpointUnpublishedParks` |\n59|| Successor null fold parks at the one implication arm | `Decide` post-fencing arm | `TestDecideSuccessorNullFoldParks`, `TestRunSuccessorNullFoldParks` |\n60|| Diverged handoff base launches from the newest; stale base parks | `checkMaterialization` / `admitCheckpoint` (fold-only) | `TestDecidePostTakeoverDivergedBaseLaunches`, `TestRunPostTakeoverRestoreLaunchesWithNewestClosure`, `TestRunPostTakeoverStaleBaseParks` |\n61|| Committed newest-sourced journal resumes | `checkMaterialization` | `TestRunRestoreCommitted`, step3 |\n62|\n63|## Profile (§2.4) and descriptor (§7.A)\n64|\n65|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n66|| --- | --- | --- |\n67|| Effective profile + source (required/newest/head) | `deriveProfile`; `Run` → `LoadProfile` | `TestDecideProfileSourcePinsEvent`, `TestDecideResumeProfileUsesClosure`, `TestRunPostTakeoverLaunchCarriesNewestClosureStandardToYolo`, `TestRunPostTakeoverLaunchCarriesNewestClosureYoloToStandard` |\n68|| Unknown checkpoint store fails the run | `Run` guard | `TestRunNoCkptStorePublishedNewestFails`, `TestRunNewestAbsentFromStoreFails` |\n69|| Mapping refusal keeps tuple class | `Decide` arm order | `TestDecideYoloMapping` |\n70|| Identity record binds the session | `Decide` → `checkIdentitySession` | `TestDecideIdentityForeignSessionRefuses` |\n71|| Binding descriptor admits + round-trips | `AdmitProviderDescriptor`, `BuildDescriptor` | descriptor tests |\n72|\n73|## Direct-session launch (§13.1 steps 3–4)\n74|\n75|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n76|| --- | --- | --- |\n77|| Durable terminal entry with op ID, then provider launch | `Run` launch path | `TestRunLaunchBinds`, `TestRunRestoreCommitted` |\n78|| One effect per outcome; refused writes nothing | `Run` | `TestRunRefusedWritesNothing`, `TestRunLaunchBinds` |\n79|\n80|## Negative-evidence index (narrowing mutants)\n81|\n82|53/53 harness rows: 52 KILLED + control (`mutants/pass1/`,\n83|`mutants/pass2-summary.log`). One narrowing mutant per P1-1\n84|conditional (`N-window-fold`, `N-checkpoint-nullfold`,\n85|`N-materialization-nullfold`, `N-checkpoint-newest`,\n86|`N-successor-nullfold`, `N-closure-source`, `N-run-ckpt-store`,\n87|`N-run-newest-absent`), per receipt gate (`N-bind-first`,\n88|`N-supersede-no-replace`, `N-supersede-replay`,\n89|`N-binding-prefix`, `N-window-lease-checkpoint`), per realm gate\n90|(`N-realm`, `N-realm-foreground`, `N-realm-deadmap`,\n91|`N-realm-binding`, `N-realm-generation`), per emission gate\n92|(`N-emit-mutation`, `N-emit-losing-epoch`, `N-parked-fold`,\n93|`N-run-fold`), the fold-error gate (`N-run-fold-error`), the\n94|identity gate (`N-identity-session`), and one per remaining\n95|decision arm (see TRACEABILITY.md mutant table).","final_result":true}}}
