iled\", err)\n289|\\t}\n290|\"\"\",\n291|        count=1,\n292|        run=\"TestDecideTable/refused_profile_derivation_corrupt\",\n293|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n294|        note=\"Admits corrupt derivation exactly for codex, surfacing the wrong class.\",\n295|    ),\n296|    Mutant(\n297|        name=\"N-profile-closure\",\n298|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/decide.go\",\n299|        find=\"\"\"\\tif len(heads) > 0 {\n300|\\t\\treturn sessprofile.DeriveForHeads(input.ProfileRecord, input.ProfileEvents, heads)\n301|\\t}\n302|\"\"\",\n303|        replace=\"\"\"\\tif len(heads) > 0 && input.Mode != ModeRestore {\n304|\\t\\treturn sessprofile.DeriveForHeads(input.ProfileRecord, input.ProfileEvents, heads)\n305|\\t}\n306|\"\"\",\n307|        count=1,\n308|        run=\"TestDecideResumeProfileUsesClosure\",\n309|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n310|        note=\"Derives the session head instead of the closure exactly on restore; launch closure still holds.\",\n311|    ),\n312|    Mutant(\n313|        name=\"N-mapping\",\n314|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/decide.go\",\n315|        find=\"\"\"\\tresolved, err := provhost.ResolveMapping(input.Provider.Build.ProviderID, pair.Profile, input.Provider.Build)\n316|\\tif err != nil {\n317|\\t\\treturn refused(ClassProfileMappingUnavailable, \"adapter cannot map the stored profile\", err)\n318|\\t}\n319|\"\"\",\n320|        replace=\"\"\"\\tresolved, err := provhost.ResolveMapping(input.Provider.Build.ProviderID, pair.Profile, input.Provider.Build)\n321|\\tif err != nil && pair.Profile != \"standard\" {\n322|\\t\\treturn refused(ClassProfileMappingUnavailable, \"adapter cannot map the stored profile\", err)\n323|\\t}\n324|\"\"\",\n325|        count=1,\n326|        run=\"TestDecideTable/refused_profile_mapping_unavailable\",\n327|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n328|        note=\"Admits exactly standard mapping gaps; yolo gaps still refuse.\",\n329|    ),\n330|    Mutant(\n331|        name=\"N-realm\",\n332|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/decide.go\",\