{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c9c3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b201-5e84-7ea0-8bc6-d79919cbe007"},"sequence":828,"recorded_at":1780531400001651,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"9e30868d-563f-43f3-9fe7-d9ddb65377f0","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"9e30868d-563f-43f3-9fe7-d9ddb65377f0","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"9e30868d-563f-43f3-9fe7-d9ddb65377f0"},"call_id":"call_01a0b2040bd174f1a169e45d69a046b3","text":"Read text file `internal/axpane/mutant_harness.py`.\n1|#!/usr/bin/env python3\n2|\"\"\"Narrowing-mutant harness for internal/axpane.\n3|\n4|Every gate ships a narrowing mutant: the gate stays present and is\n5|weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and\n6|the named killer test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that\n7|the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence.\n8|\n9|Each row runs M (mutate one production file in place), R (run the\n10|scoped Go killer through the production entry point), V (verdict from\n11|the Go exit code plus a FAIL kill-line: KILLED iff R fails with a test\n12|failure line, SURVIVED iff R passes, ERROR for anything else —\n13|unapplied patches, build breaks, timeouts). M failures and R\n14|infrastructure errors are ERROR, never kills or survivals. The file is\n15|restored from its backup after every row, pass or fail.\n16|\n17|Row C-doc-comment is the harmless control: a comment-only edit that\n18|must SURVIVE, proving the harness observes test outcomes instead of\n19|hard-coding kills.\n20|\n21|Usage:\n22|  PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/axpane/mutant_harness.py\n23|  PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/axpane/mutant_harness.py N-config\n24|\"\"\"\n25|\n26|import os\n27|import shutil\n28|import subprocess\n29|import sys\n30|import tempfile\n31|from dataclasses import dataclass\n32|from pathlib import Path\n33|\n34|REPO = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]\n35|PACKAGE = \"internal/axpane\"\n36|\n37|\n38|@dataclass(frozen=True)\n39|class Mutant:\n40|    name: str\n41|    path: str\n42|    find: str\n43|    replace: str\n44|    count: int\n45|    run: str\n46|    expect: str\n47|    note: str\n48|\n49|\n50|MUTANTS = [\n51|    Mutant(\n52|        name=\"N-config\",\n53|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/decide.go\",\n54|        find=\"\\tif input.ConfigErr != nil {\\n\",\n55|        replace=\"\\tif input.ConfigErr != nil && input.Mode == ModeRestore {\\n\",\n56|        count=1,\n57|        run=\"TestDecideTable/refused_config_invalid\",\n58|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n59|        note=\"Admits exactly launch-mode invalid config; restore-mode still refuses.\",\n60|    ),\n61|    Mutant(\n62|        name=\"N-mode\",\n63|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/decide.go\",\n64|        find=\"\\tif input.Mode != ModeLaunch && input.Mode != ModeRestore {\\n\",\n65|        replace='\\tif input.Mode != ModeLaunch && input.Mode != ModeRestore && input.Mode != Mode(\"\") {\\n',\n66|        count=1,\n67|        run=\"TestDecideTable/refused_empty_mode\",\n68|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n69|        note=\"Admits exactly the empty mode; every other non-mode still refuses.\",\n70|    ),\n71|    Mutant(\n72|        name=\"N-session\",\n73|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/decide.go\",\n74|        find=\"\\tif !input.SessionKnown {\\n\",\n75|        replace=\"\\tif !input.SessionKnown && input.Mode == ModeRestore {\\n\",\n76|        count=1,\n77|        run=\"TestDecideTable/refused_unknown_session\",\n78|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n79|        note=\"Admits exactly launch-mode unknown sessions; restore-mode still refuses.\",\n80|    ),\n81|    Mutant(\n82|        name=\"N-idempotency\",\n83|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/decide.go\",\n84|        find=\"\\tif (input.ExistingBinding == nil || input.ExistingBinding.OperationID != input.BootstrapOperationID) && input.SessionBound && !bootstrapWindowClosed(input) {\\n\",\n85|        replace=\"\\tif (input.ExistingBinding == nil || input.ExistingBinding.OperationID != input.BootstrapOperationID) && input.SessionBound && !bootstrapWindowClosed(input) && input.Mode == ModeRestore {\\n\",\n86|        count=1,\n87|        run=\"TestDecideTable/refused_idempotency_mismatch\",\n88|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n89|        note=\"Admits exactly launch-mode changed operations inside the window; restore-mode still refuses.\",\n90|    ),\n91|    Mutant(\n92|        name=\"N-idempotency-restore\",\n93|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/decide.go\",\n94|        find=\"\\tif (input.ExistingBinding == nil || input.ExistingBinding.OperationID != input.BootstrapOperationID) && input.SessionBound && !bootstrapWindowClosed(input) {\\n\",\n95|        replace=\"\\tif (input.ExistingBinding == nil || input.ExistingBinding.OperationID != input.BootstrapOperationID) && input.SessionBound && !bootstrapWindowClosed(input) && input.Mode == ModeLaunch {\\n\",\n96|        count=1,\n97|        run=\"TestDecideRestoreChangedOperationRefuses\",\n98|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n99|        note=\"Admits exactly restore-mode changed operations inside the window; launch-mode still refuses.\",\n100|    ),\n101|    Mutant(\n102|        name=\"N-idempotency-bound\",\n103|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/decide.go\",\n104|        find=\"\\tif (input.ExistingBinding == nil || input.ExistingBinding.OperationID != input.BootstrapOperationID) && input.SessionBound && !bootstrapWindowClosed(input) {\\n\",\n105|        replace=\"\\tif (input.ExistingBinding == nil || input.ExistingBinding.OperationID != input.BootstrapOperationID) && input.SessionBound && !bootstrapWindowClosed(input) && input.ExistingBinding != nil {\\n\",\n106|        count=1,\n107|        run=\"TestDecideRestoreChangedOperationRefuses\",\n108|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n109|        note=\"Admits exactly unrecorded pairs on bound sessions, requiring a mismatched recorded receipt; other changed pairs still refuse.\",\n110|    ),\n111|    Mutant(\n112|        name=\"N-win