in only sanitized provider/task-board arguments. Secret\\n1733:- a sanitized non-authoritative source native session ID;\\n1971:replicated. The evidence IDs MUST resolve locally to validated, sanitized\\n2257:| <code>kind = git</code> | <code>workspace_id:UUIDv7</code>, <code>kind:git</code>, <code>group_relative_path:path</code>, <code>repository_identity:string[1..256]</code>, <code>sanitized_remote_urls:sorted unique sanitized-git-URL[1..16]</code>, <code>repo_relative_cwd:.&#124;path</code>, <code>agent_project_config_paths:sorted unique path[0..256]</code>, <code>materialization_policy:shared_checkout&#124;separate_worktree</code> |\\n2260:A sanitized Git URL uses <code>https</code>, <code>ssh</code>, or provider-neutral\\n2287:      \\\"sanitized_remote_urls\\\": [\\\"ssh://git@github.com/relux/payments-api.git\\\"],\\n2323:<code>WG-N1</code> adds <code>sanitized_remote_urls</code> to that\\n2622:| <code>default_metadata_policy</code> | <code>local_only|mesh_sanitized|reference_only</code>; default local_only on upgrade and mesh_sanitized only for a newly initialized trusted mesh after explicit setup choice |\\n2623:| <code>generated_summary_upgrade_choice</code> | <code>unset|local_only|mesh_sanitized|reference_only</code>; existing meshes require a non-unset choice before replication |\\n2647:<code>metadata_policy:local_only|mesh_sanitized|reference_only</code>, and\\n2703:MUST safely show sanitized identity, versions, platform, availability,\\n3692:options in a sanitized launch plan are applied only after an exact-version\\n====\\ninternal/terminalbackend/manifest.go:259:\\tmaxNativeReference = 512\\ninternal/terminalbackend/conformance.go:830:\\t\\t\\\"native_reference\\\", \\\"idempotency_receipt\\\", \\\"last_effect\\\",\\ninternal/terminalbackend/conformance.go:855:\\t\\t\\\"credential_detail\\\", \\\"live_process_fact\\\", \\\"raw_native_reference\\\",\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2788,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 697,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
