ig -cover -count=1\\n396:    go run ./internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck -section 6.2\\n406:`internal/hosttrust` owns the machine-local Host Trust Store 1.0.0 and the\\n431:`internal/config.PreviewV4` renders the exact Configuration 4.0.0 bytes for a\\n445:go test ./internal/hosttrust -count=1 -v\\n446:go test ./internal/config -count=1 -v\\n447:go test ./internal/hosttrust -cover -count=1\\n448:go test ./internal/config -cover -count=1\\n449:python3 internal/hosttrust/mutations.py --output .temp/<TASK-ID>/mutations-hosttrust\\n450:python3 internal/config/mutations_v4.py --output .temp/<TASK-ID>/mutations-config\\n460:[`internal/provider`](internal/provider) implements the Section 7.1 trusted\\n491:go test ./internal/provider -count=1\\n492:go test ./internal/provider -cover -count=1\\n499:against the digest-pinned document in `internal/specdoc`, quoting the exact\\n504:[`internal/provhost`](internal/provhost) implements the ax host side of\\n574:go test ./internal/provhost -count=1\\n====\\n6:## Project Status\\n23:## Bootstrap\\n53:## Implementation Plan\\n77:## Normative Source Pin\\n107:## Pinned Specification Document\\n151:## Common Wire Scalar Types\\n210:## Configuration Loading and Versioned Schemas\\n404:## Host Trust Store and Configuration 4.0.0\\n458:## Provider Plugin Discovery and Trust\\n502:## Provider Plugin JSONL Protocol\\n597:## Safe Process and Filesystem Primitives\\n696:## Security Conformance Test Instrument\\n786:## Continuous Conformance Gates (CI)\\n845:## Canonical JSON and Immutable Object Identities\\n1504:## Safe Local Layout, Immutable Blob Sink, and SQLite Projection\\n1698:## Session Repository and Append-Only Event Chain\\n1825:## Session State Reducer\\n1938:## Execution profiles: derivation, set-profile, and provider mapping\\n2038:## Native-resume smoke: provider checks and tuple refusals\\n2095:## Provider and pane fencing gates\\n2150:## Pane enforcement wrapper (`ax pane` validation core)\\n2215:## Ownership reducer proper