8 packages ok) |\n+| 5 | `go test ./... -race -count=1 -timeout 25m` | 1 — solely the pre-existing resumesmoke failure (38 packages ok) |\n+| 6 | `go test ./... -cover -count=1` | 1 — solely the pre-existing resumesmoke failure (terminstance 82.3%) |\n+| 7–12 | rpcwire/scalar/canonicaljson fuzz ×6 (`-fuzztime=100x`) | 0 ×6 |\n+| 13–20 | secconftest fuzz ×8 (`-fuzztime=100x`) | 0 ×8 |\n+| 21 | `go run ./internal/traceability/cmd/tracecheck` | 0 (contracts=64, cases=135, clauses 49/569 — trunk figures unchanged) |\n+| 22 | `go run ./internal/catalog/cmd/cataloggen -adopted -output internal/catalog/catalog_gen.go -check` | 0, tree unmodified |\n+| 23 | `GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 go build ./...` | 0 |\n+| 24 | `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go build ./...` | 0 |\n+| 25 | `git ls-files -z '*.json' \\| xargs -0 -n1 python3 -c 'import json,sys;json.load(open(sys.argv[1]))'` | 0 |\n+| 26 | `task-board validate` | 0 (184 pre-existing MISSING_ACTIVITY issues on unrelated elements; zero name this task or story) |\n+| 27 | `git diff --check` | 0 |\n+\n+Full logs in `cmd/` inside\n+`TASK-260830-kkh1an_producer-evidence.tar.gz`. The `.go` tree was\n+verified byte-identical before and after the race gate\n+(`go-sha-before-race.txt`), so the race ran against the exact\n+candidate.\n+\n+## Pre-existing failure (finding, not a gate of this leaf)\n+\n+`TestSmokeThroughRealProviderProcess` (`internal/resumesmoke`,\n+`probe=fail`) fails identically on the committed base HEAD without\n+this leaf's changes (proven in a detached base worktree, since\n+removed) and has no dependency edge to this leaf (`go list -deps`\n+shows neither `terminstance` nor `axpane`); the base packages it\n+covers are untouched by both story leaves (`git diff 2fc6d50\n+e6fe5c5` touches only `internal/axpane`, `README.md`, `LOGBOOK.md`).\n+`terminstance`, `axpane` and `terminalbackend` are green in the\n+full, race, and coverage runs alike. Failing gates stay failing:\n+commands 4–6 are reported exit 1 with the single named cause.\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":".temp/TASK-260830-kkh1an/TASK-260830-kkh1an_results.md","added":36,"removed":20},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
